{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And he said</b> — He answered them regarding the latter matter, that he is of the sons of Eber, who are so called because they hold the faith of Eber the first, who is the father of all the sons of Eber. And he fears none but HaShem, from whose presence he fled. And he mentioned the heavens and the earth and the sea, the reason being 'for I know that He made them,' and over all He rules."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:55.842548453Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}